---
// Privatlivspolitik i almindeligt engelsk. Kræves af AdSense; skal opdateres
// når reklamer eller statistik slås til.
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy — The Gentle AI Guide"
  description="What this site collects about you (very little), what it stores in your browser, and what changes if advertisements are switched on."
>
  <article class="article">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p class="lede">The short version: this site collects almost nothing about you, and we'd like to keep it that way.</p>
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p><strong>No account, no sign-up, no forms.</strong> You can read everything here without telling us who you are. We don't collect names, email addresses or anything else unless you choose to write to us.</p>
      <p><strong>Server records.</strong> Like every website, the company that hosts this site (Cloudflare) keeps standard technical records of visits — the address of the page you asked for, the time, and the general type of browser. These are used to keep the site running and protect it from attacks. We don't use them to identify you.</p>

      <h2>What's stored in your browser</h2>
      <p>If you press the <strong>A / A+ / A++</strong> text-size buttons, your choice is saved in your own browser so the site remembers it next time. That's all. It never leaves your computer, and clearing your browser's site data removes it.</p>
      <p>We do not currently use analytics cookies or tracking pixels.</p>

      <h2>Fonts</h2>
      <p>The typefaces on this site are loaded from Google Fonts. When a page loads, your browser asks Google's servers for the font files, which means Google sees the request. If you'd prefer that didn't happen, your browser's settings or an ad-blocker can prevent it; the site still works with your computer's own fonts.</p>

      <h2>If we switch on advertising</h2>
      <p>To cover its costs, this site may in future show a small number of clearly labelled advertisements through Google AdSense. If and when that happens, this page will be updated first, and:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Google and its partners may use cookies to show ads based on your previous visits to this and other websites.</li>
        <li>You can opt out of personalised advertising at <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads">google.com/settings/ads</a>.</li>
        <li>Visitors in the EU and UK will be asked for consent before any advertising cookies are set.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Advertisements will never be disguised as articles, and no article will recommend a product because someone paid for it.</p>

      <h2>Writing to us</h2>
      <p>If you email <a href="mailto:hello@gentleaiguide.com">hello@gentleaiguide.com</a>, we keep your message so we can reply. We don't add you to any list, and we don't share your address with anyone.</p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>If anything on this page changes, the date below will change with it.</p>
      <p><em>Last updated: 4 September 2026.</em></p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
